OL,3,GNEWSAPowerlifter returns to world
OL,4,Achampionship podium
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has returned to the world
OL,7,Fchampionship podium for powerlifting,
OL,8,Feight years after winning a gold medal
OL,9,Fin the sport.
OL,11,FAneela Rose, from Burgess Hill, secured
OL,12,Fsilver at the championships after
OL,13,Ffailing to qualify five months earlier.
OL,15,FAt a qualifier in Eastbourne, she
OL,16,Flifted 242kg, 10kg more than was needed
OL,17,Fto reach the championships, before
OL,18,Flifting 247.5kg to win silver.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
