OL,3,GNEWSAPowerlifter returns to world
OL,4,Achampionship podium
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of two told BBC Radio
OL,7,FSussex: "I started by accident after
OL,8,Fthe London 2012 Olympics, I started
OL,9,Fthrowing the javelin but kept getting
OL,10,Finjured. I was told to strengthen up
OL,11,Fbut my PT told me I was freakishly
OL,12,Fstrong."
